      "writtenOn": "2019-03-15T19:26:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you.\n\nI confirmed that the code will use pd_dfp_pe_init() to clear the amodes array after disconnect and any time the check identity sequence starts again, so pd_dfp_dp_get_pin_mode() should return 0 unless we\u0027ve actually entered a mode on that port. So this should be generally safe, though if the host command comes through between the enter mode and filling in dp_status, it won\u0027t pick up whether the multi-function preferred bit was set.  \n\nHow precise does your timing for using this host command need to be?",
      "parentUuid": "b0291d32_f357e3b9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4975,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 4975,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "6cf5294e139a0b9d893958d6cac8d2b3855df210",
