      "writtenOn": "2019-03-15T19:34:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the feedback Diana,\nusbc event happens -\u003e virtual MUX sends EC_HOST_EVENT_USB_MUX -\u003e Kernel reads USB mux, if the mux has DP flag then -\u003e Kernel request hc_usb_pd_control(), by this time dp_pin mode will be already set hence timing is okay.",
      "parentUuid": "54fa29df_63dae081",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4975,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 4975,
        "endChar": 33
